{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB節目《唱錢》的「緊張魔咒」威力驚人，連實力派星級唱將黃洛妍（Janees）都無法倖免！Janees在「復仇之夜」挑戰「Monster」歌曲《睡公主》，賽前本來充滿期待，豈料一站上舞台即緊張到「口窒窒」，演唱時更一度入錯音，表情極度痛苦，場面震撼！</p><p>黃洛妍未唱先驚：「呢個地方會令人好緊張」</p><p>作為星級唱將獲邀登場，Janees賽前坦言「收到邀請好開心」，對挑戰充滿期待。然而，當她真正站上那個傳說中充滿壓力的舞台後，緊張情緒立即湧上心頭，更忍不住「口窒窒」地向鏡頭承認：「我再重申多次，呢個地方會令到個人好緊張。」專業歌手的坦白，足證這個舞台的魔力有多可怕。</p><p>挑戰《睡公主》開聲即入錯音</p><p>Janees今次挑戰的「Monster」歌曲是《睡公主》，此曲音域跨度極大，對氣息控制的要求非常高，極度考驗歌手的聲帶張力。沒想到，在舞台壓力影響下，Janees一開聲已感受到她極度緊繃的狀態，更在一開始便「入錯音」，表現失準，與平時的穩定發揮大相逕庭，令現場眾人相當驚訝。</p><p>黃洛妍表情痛苦顯吃力</p><p>在整個演唱過程中，Janees的表情顯得相當痛苦和吃力，完全不像在享受音樂，反而像在與歌曲和舞台壓力搏鬥。連唱功備受肯定的專業歌手都表現得如此艱難，再次證明《唱錢》的音樂系統和舞台設計對所有演唱者都構成巨大心理壓力，究竟8位復仇者及星級唱將最終能否成功一雪前恥，實在充滿懸念。</p><p>網民震驚：「連Janees都咁？」</p><p>專業歌手失準的畫面，讓網民大感震驚，紛紛留言討論：「嘩！連Janees都搞唔掂，呢個節目真係有魔咒！」、「證明咗呢個唔係普通K房唱歌，係專業級嘅地獄挑戰！」、「睇到佢個樣都覺得辛苦，好佩服所有參賽者嘅勇氣。」、「平時聽佢唱歌好穩，今次咁緊張，個舞台壓力真係非同小可。」、「好想知最後結果係點！」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01_16703870336a8fc589b3ba3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02_10665355646a8fc58c92e90.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/03_14613993086a8fc596b5891.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04a_16898774186a8fc59b0a91e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04_2925180146a8fc5a107228.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/05_7514158686a8fc5a4d4e9f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/06_10904091116a8fc5a7c73c2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/07_15696684416a8fc5aad773a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/08_13028681926a8fc5ae5b39f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/09_4113610676a8fc5b28cc53.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10_12443099256a8fc5b6bf59e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/11_19627248326a8fc5ba047bc.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/12_3140655656a8fc5bfcc9c2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/13_1320968416a8fc5c3ad866.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/14_1777089456a8fc5c705231.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/15_10728386596a8fc5ca2aef1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16_16707632686a8fc5ce883f8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17_7754104726a8fc5d1c7566.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/18_5960832266a8fc5d50038f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/19_624068066a8fc5d97837b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20_5552917456a8fc5dfb1964.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/21_11633212626a8fc5e293f04.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/22_8281722056a8fc5e76ebe4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/23_8951361156a8fc5ea97996.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/24_13450112436a8fc5ed9ca2f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/25_14815827636a8fc5f0e2746.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/26_5469868516a8fc5f475426.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T05:19:02.088122+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1017,"images":27,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}